<title>JAPAN: Japan EPA expects 96/97 GDP growth to exceed 2.5%.</title>
<headline>Japan EPA expects 96/97 GDP growth to exceed 2.5%.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Growth in Japan's gross domestic product (GDP) in fiscal 1996/97 is expected to exceed the government's target of 2.5 percent, Economic Planning Agency (EPA) Vice Minister Shimpei Nukaya said on Friday.</p>
</text>
